  <diagram name="Page-1" id="VhZkQWGmc5Ws8cyMVKx-">
    <mxGraphModel dx="3396" dy="2007" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;\n@startuml\ntitle HR Identity &amp; Access Management - Use Case Diagram\n\nleft to right direction\n\n&#39; ==================== VISUAL STYLE ====================\n\nskinparam linetype ortho\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam actorStyle awesome\nskinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC\n\nskinparam packageBackgroundColor #EAF2F8\nskinparam packageBorderColor #4F6D8A\nskinparam packageFontColor #1E293B\nskinparam packageFontStyle bold\nskinparam packageFontSize 14\n\nskinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF\nskinparam usecaseBorderColor #64748B\nskinparam usecaseFontColor #0F172A\nskinparam usecaseFontSize 13\n\nskinparam actorBorderColor #2563EB\nskinparam actorFontColor #1E3A8A\n\nskinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8DB\nskinparam noteBorderColor #D6A700\n\nskinparam ArrowColor #475569\nskinparam ArrowFontColor #334155\n\nskinparam roundcorner 14\nskinparam nodesep 35\nskinparam ranksep 55\nskinparam PackagePadding 18\n\nskinparam TitleFontSize 18\nskinparam TitleFontStyle bold\n\n&#39; ==================== ACTOR ====================\n\nactor \&quot;HR Manager\&quot; as Manager\n\n&#39; ==================== SYSTEM BOUNDARY ====================\n\nrectangle \&quot;Identity &amp; Access Management\&quot; {\n\n    &#39; ==================== ROLE MANAGEMENT ====================\n\n    package \&quot;Role Management\&quot; {\n\n        usecase \&quot;View Roles\&quot; as UC11\n        usecase \&quot;Create Role\&quot; as UC12\n        usecase \&quot;Update Role\&quot; as UC13\n        usecase \&quot;Delete Role\&quot; as UC14\n\n        usecase \&quot;Validate Role Data\&quot; as UC15\n        usecase \&quot;Check Role Dependencies\&quot; as UC16\n    }\n\n    &#39; ==================== PERMISSION MANAGEMENT ====================\n\n    package \&quot;Permission Management\&quot; {\n\n        usecase \&quot;View Permissions\&quot; as UC17\n        usecase \&quot;Create Permission\&quot; as UC18\n        usecase \&quot;Update Permission\&quot; as UC19\n        usecase \&quot;Delete Permission\&quot; as UC20\n\n        usecase \&quot;Validate Permission Data\&quot; as UC21\n        usecase \&quot;Check Permission Dependencies\&quot; as UC22\n    }\n\n    &#39; ==================== ROLE ASSIGNMENT ====================\n\n    package \&quot;Role Assignment\&quot; {\n\n        usecase \&quot;View Employee Roles\&quot; as UC23\n        usecase \&quot;Assign Employee Role\&quot; as UC24\n        usecase \&quot;Change Employee Role\&quot; as UC25\n        usecase \&quot;Remove Employee Role\&quot; as UC26\n\n        usecase \&quot;Validate Role Assignment\&quot; as UC27\n\n        usecase \&quot;View Role Permissions\&quot; as UC28\n        usecase \&quot;Assign Role Permission\&quot; as UC29\n        usecase \&quot;Remove Role Permission\&quot; as UC30\n\n        usecase \&quot;Validate Permission Assignment\&quot; as UC31\n        usecase \&quot;Record Role and Permission Activity\&quot; as UC34\n    }\n\n    &#39; ==================== SECURITY &amp; AUDITING ====================\n\n    package \&quot;Security &amp; Auditing\&quot; {\n\n        usecase \&quot;View Audit Trail\&quot; as UC32\n        usecase \&quot;Review Security Events\&quot; as UC33\n    }\n}\n\n&#39; ==================== LAYOUT HINTS ====================\n\n&#39; Role Management - Main Actions\nUC11 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC12\nUC12 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC13\nUC13 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC14\n\n&#39; Role Management - Validation\nUC12 -[hidden]right-&gt; UC15\nUC14 -[hidden]right-&gt; UC16\nUC15 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC16\n\n&#39; Permission Management - Main Actions\nUC17 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC18\nUC18 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC19\nUC19 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC20\n\n&#39; Permission Management - Validation\nUC18 -[hidden]right-&gt; UC21\nUC20 -[hidden]right-&gt; UC22\nUC21 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC22\n\n&#39; Role Assignment - Employee Roles\nUC23 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC24\nUC24 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC25\nUC25 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC26\n\n&#39; Role Assignment - Role Validation\nUC24 -[hidden]right-&gt; UC27\n\n&#39; Role Assignment - Permissions\nUC28 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC29\nUC29 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC30\nUC29 -[hidden]right-&gt; UC31\nUC31 -[hidden]right-&gt; UC34\n\n&#39; Security &amp; Auditing\nUC32 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC33\n\n&#39; ==================== PACKAGE ALIGNMENT ====================\n\n&#39; Top Row\nUC11 -[hidden]right-&gt; UC17\n\n&#39; Bottom Row\nUC23 -[hidden]right-&gt; UC32\n\n&#39; Vertical Alignment\nUC11 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC23\nUC17 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC32\n\n&#39; Actor Position\nManager -[hidden]right-&gt; UC11\n\n&#39; ==================== ACTOR ASSOCIATIONS ====================\n\nManager -- UC11\nManager -- UC12\nManager -- UC13\nManager -- UC14\n\nManager -- UC17\nManager -- UC18\nManager -- UC19\nManager -- UC20\n\nManager -- UC23\nManager -- UC24\nManager -- UC25\nManager -- UC26\n\nManager -- UC28\nManager -- UC29\nManager -- UC30\n\nManager -- UC32\n\n\n&#39; ==================== ROLE VALIDATION ====================\n\nUC12 ..&gt; UC15 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC13 ..&gt; UC15 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC14 ..&gt; UC16 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; ==================== PERMISSION VALIDATION ====================\n\nUC18 ..&gt; UC21 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC19 ..&gt; UC21 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC20 ..&gt; UC22 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; ==================== ASSIGNMENT VALIDATION ====================\n\nUC24 ..&gt; UC27 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC25 ..&gt; UC27 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC29 ..&gt; UC31 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; ==================== SECURITY LOGGING ====================\n\nUC24 ..&gt; UC34 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC25 ..&gt; UC34 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC26 ..&gt; UC34 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC29 ..&gt; UC34 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC30 ..&gt; UC34 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\nUC33 ..&gt; UC32 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; ==================== NOTES ====================\n\nnote right of UC34\n  Record important role and\n  permission-related activities\n  for auditing purposes.\nend note\n\nnote right of UC27\n  Users cannot modify their own privileges\n  or assign permissions they are not\n  authorized to manage.\nend note\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="vNo0hs9uBKSM-cNliJXH-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
